findings:
  - {check: ownership - unrecorded, nodes: ['C:bond/org-backs-mdc', 'C:bond/foundation-incubated-mdc'], finding: 'Two Mozilla organizations are affiliated with the company, and Companies House records no one with significant control: the model holds both affiliations and no ownership share.', proposal: Ask what "mission-locked" means in the articles when they are published.}
